const e={readingNotes:[{title:{zh:"外部投资者为何能拿回收益",en:"Why can outside investors receive the cash flows?"},body:{zh:"论文不把企业创造现金流与投资者实际获得现金流视为同一件事。管理者或控制股东可能通过关联交易、资产转移或其他安排取得私人收益。公司治理因此不仅是经理效率问题，也涉及外部股东和债权人如何限制内部人的攫取。",en:"Creating cash flows and returning them to investors are different matters. Managers or controlling shareholders can divert value through related transactions or other arrangements. Governance therefore concerns not just managerial efficiency but how outside shareholders and creditors constrain insiders."},reference:{url:"https://www.nber.org/system/files/working_papers/w7428/w7428.pdf",label:{zh:"1999年NBER工作稿 · §1 · pp. 1–2",en:"1999 NBER working paper · §1 · pp. 1–2"}}},{title:{zh:"现金流权与控制权不能混作持股比例",en:"Cash-flow rights and control rights are different"},body:{zh:"作者从现金流索取权进一步讨论改变董事、阻止有害项目或要求清算等权力。获得多少经济收益与能够左右多少决策未必一致。分析股权结构时，只列直接持股比例可能遗漏控制链条，不能据此完整判断外部投资者受到怎样的保护。",en:"The paper moves from cash-flow claims to powers such as changing directors, blocking harmful projects or pursuing liquidation. Economic ownership and decision power need not coincide. Direct share percentages alone can miss control chains and do not fully describe investor protection."},reference:{url:"https://www.nber.org/system/files/working_papers/w7428/w7428.pdf",label:{zh:"1999年NBER工作稿 · §1 · p. 3",en:"1999 NBER working paper · §1 · p. 3"}}},{title:{zh:"规则内容与执行效果一起看",en:"Read legal rules together with enforcement"},body:{zh:"研究把法律、监管、交易所规则和实际执行共同纳入投资者保护。纸面上存在某项权利，并不说明行使成本低或执行可靠。这个区分也意味着不能只靠一张法规清单比较治理质量，更不能用历史法律分类推断当前个案的法律结果。",en:"Investor protection includes laws, regulations, exchange rules and their enforcement. A formal right does not establish inexpensive or reliable exercise. A rule checklist alone cannot compare governance quality, and historical legal classifications do not determine the outcome of a current case."},reference:{url:"https://www.nber.org/system/files/working_papers/w7428/w7428.pdf",label:{zh:"1999年NBER工作稿 · §2 · p. 6",en:"1999 NBER working paper · §2 · p. 6"}}},{title:{zh:"股东与债权人的保护对象不同",en:"Shareholder and creditor protections address different claims"},body:{zh:"股东权利可能涉及投票、同等分红或新股认购，债权人权利则更多涉及抵押物、优先顺序与重组。两者都属于外部投资者保护，但不应合成一个没有解释的总标签。融资方式变化，也可能改变各方权力与激励的分配。",en:"Shareholder protections can concern voting, proportional payouts and issue participation; creditor protections concern collateral, priority and reorganization. Both protect outsiders but should not be collapsed into an unexplained label. Financing choices can change the distribution of power and incentives."},reference:{url:"https://www.nber.org/system/files/working_papers/w7428/w7428.pdf",label:{zh:"1999年NBER工作稿 · §2 · p. 6",en:"1999 NBER working paper · §2 · p. 6"}}},{title:{zh:"集中持有既有约束作用，也有控制问题",en:"Concentrated ownership can constrain and create control problems"},body:{zh:"较高现金流持有可能让内部人与外部投资者利益更一致，但集中控制也使少数股东面临被侵占的风险。论文将所有权结构与投资者保护联系起来，不把集中或分散简单划为好坏。现金流持有与控制集中必须分别解释。",en:"Greater insider cash-flow ownership can align incentives, while concentrated control can expose minority investors to diversion. The paper connects ownership patterns with protection rather than labeling concentration uniformly good or bad. Economic ownership and control concentration require separate interpretation."},reference:{url:"https://www.nber.org/system/files/working_papers/w7428/w7428.pdf",label:{zh:"1999年NBER工作稿 · §3 · p. 15",en:"1999 NBER working paper · §3 · p. 15"}}},{title:{zh:"制度比较不是单一企业的因果证明",en:"Institutional comparison is not firm-level causal proof"},body:{zh:"这篇综述把不同国家的融资、所有权和保护机制放在同一框架下。编辑解读：跨国规律不能独自解释某家公司的价值变化，也不能替代对关系融资等其他机制的研究。与中国部门研究并读时，尤其要区分公开资本市场与非上市企业。",en:"The review relates financing, ownership and protection across countries. Editorial interpretation: those regularities do not alone explain one firm's valuation change or replace study of relationship finance. Comparisons with China's sector evidence should distinguish public markets from unlisted firms."},reference:{url:"https://www.nber.org/system/files/working_papers/w7428/w7428.pdf",label:{zh:"1999年NBER工作稿 · §1; §3–4",en:"1999 NBER working paper · §1; §3–4"}}}],readerLimits:{zh:"导读采用与期刊论文相连的1999年工作稿。跨国历史研究不能替代当前法律判断；现金流权、控制权和实际执行效果需要分别识别。",en:"This guide uses the associated 1999 working paper. Historical cross-country research does not establish current law; cash-flow rights, control rights and enforcement must be distinguished."}};export{e as default};
